# p090-floor3: the statistics settle's rare path. The publication settles
# the candidate's statistics (the journal replayed into it, the lookup
# table freed) before it takes its view pool; a statistic queued after
# that settle and before the publication's finish needs the table again.
# The finish must see the journal moved ("cand stats moved after settle"),
# refuse, prepare anew and publish on the retry, with the statistic in the
# new library. commit_hold 102 holds the publication at the finish's
# start (inside its locked part; queueing a statistic takes no lock), and
# stat_write queues a rating there, as the shell's rating does.
# Red arm: without the finish's cursor check the line never appears.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p090-settle-moved.script
# needs: library
# golden: skip
# timeout: 240
# logafter: held cand stats moved after settle: prepare again
# logafter: held db gen \d+ n=
wait 4000
wait_db 45000
stat_idx /Music/Tone%20Collective/Sine%20Studies/01%20Concert%20A.mp3
stat_mark /Music/Tone%20Collective/Sine%20Studies/01%20Concert%20A.mp3 rating
commit_hold 102
db_mark
db_gen_mark
copy ../../tests/fixtures/plain.mp3 /Music/p090-settle.mp3
update_db
commit_hold_wait 90000
ab_mark held
stat_write rating 7
commit_release
expect_db_grew 90000
expect_db_gen_change 90000  # published on the retry
wait 1000
expect_stat /Music/Tone%20Collective/Sine%20Studies/01%20Concert%20A.mp3 rating=7..7 5000
shot end
stat_idx /Music/Tone%20Collective/Sine%20Studies/01%20Concert%20A.mp3
stat_write rating 0
rm_file /Music/p090-settle.mp3
quit
